From 5126cab37c5484c303f322f280db408c2a540960 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ash Pera <ashley.pera@noaa.gov>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:04:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 02/19] mp_thompson: convert to and from mixing ratio with the
 same humidity

FV3 hands physics tracers per (dry air + vapour) and rebuilds each species'
mass afterwards as the pre-physics thickness times the returned value. The
driver converted to mixing ratios with /(1-spechum) but back with
/(1+qv_new), so every species returned scaled by (m_d+m_v,old)/(m_d+m_v,new):
net evaporation in the scheme removed water, net condensation created it.

Convert back with *(1-spechum), the scheme's unchanged input, so the round
trip is exact on whatever basis the host supplies (also when sub-cycling).

Measured (C96 control_p8_ugwpv1): Thompson's water residual -0.67 % -> -0.30 %
of grid-scale precipitation.

Adapted to production/GFS.v17 (8007f2c3e) from ufs/dev c7dc705. This branch converts spechum in place (no new_spechum): the entry conversion already uses the input humidity, so only the return conversion changes, and spechum is overwritten after the species.
---
 physics/MP/Thompson/mp_thompson.F90 | 28 +++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/physics/MP/Thompson/mp_thompson.F90 b/physics/MP/Thompson/mp_thompson.F90
index 666a8a53..301dd782 100644
--- a/physics/MP/Thompson/mp_thompson.F90
+++ b/physics/MP/Thompson/mp_thompson.F90
@@ -867,23 +867,25 @@ module mp_thompson
          ! was using these arrays, but it is somewhat dangerous.
 
          !> - Convert water vapor mixing ratio back to specific humidity
-         spechum = qv/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-
+         ! convert back with the input (host-basis) humidity, as on entry, so the host's mass rebuild is exact;
+         ! spechum still holds the input here, so it is overwritten last
          if (convert_dry_rho) then
-           qc = qc/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-           qr = qr/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-           qi = qi/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-           qs = qs/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-           qg = qg/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-
-           ni = ni/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-           nr = nr/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
+           qc = qc*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+           qr = qr*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+           qi = qi*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+           qs = qs*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+           qg = qg*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+
+           ni = ni*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+           nr = nr*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
            if (is_aerosol_aware .or. merra2_aerosol_aware) then
-              nc = nc/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-              nwfa = nwfa/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
-              nifa = nifa/(1.0_kind_phys+qv)
+              nc = nc*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+              nwfa = nwfa*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
+              nifa = nifa*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
            end if
          end if
+
+         spechum = qv*(1.0_kind_phys-spechum)
          ! *DH
 
          !> - Convert rainfall deltas from mm to m (on physics timestep); add to inout variables
